{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "401e0dc4-8303-8f15-88b0-fed2d269d89e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:41:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:37:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Kevin. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I'm calling the storm line like the recording said. It's Richard Sisson."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:38:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, that's what the line's for. What's going on, Richard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:38:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a drain here that's not taking any water since the nor'easter yesterday, Friday into Saturday. Water's sitting across the crosswalk by the school bus stop. I'm at 422 Ocean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "422 Ocean Avenue, okay. Writing that down. Drain at the crosswalk by the bus stop, not draining after the storm. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:38:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps on a car that just went through. Not a little puddle. And the kids wait right there, so they're stepping out into the road to get around it. Cars are coming through and not slowing down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. Kids in the road, got it. Is it the side of the street where the bus stops, or across?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same side as the bus stop, right at the corner where you cross. Hold on. [pause] Sam, não, ainda não, I'm on the phone with the city. Sorry about that, my nephew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all right. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. He's got a job application, his first one, and I'm helping him with it, so I'm in the middle of that and looking out the window at this water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good for him. Alright, so I've got the location, the depth, the bus stop. Let me get a number for you, in case somebody needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the cell, so it's fine if I don't pick up right away. Just leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six zero, perfect. I'm putting this in as a storm drain blocked, standing water at a crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So will there be a work order opened? That's what I want to know. And for what date? Because I don't want to hear we'll get to it. School's tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening the work order now, so it'll exist today. As for a date, the crews are working through a pile of storm calls, and weekend ones go into the Monday list. I'd say it gets looked at Monday, maybe Tuesday. Since there's a bus stop involved I'm flagging it as a safety item so it moves up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:40:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday or Tuesday. Okay. Monday's the one I care about, honestly, with the kids going out there at seven thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in the notes that it's the school bus stop and that kids are walking around the water into the road. That's the part that gets somebody out there first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because the water doesn't go anywhere, and it's been sitting there since last night. It's just sitting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so the drain's probably packed with leaves and sand from the storm. Crew can clear that pretty quick once they're on site. If it gets worse before then, or it freezes over tonight, call this line back and I or whoever's here will add it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Freezing, great. Alright. Can you read me back the address so I know it's right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "422 Ocean Avenue, crosswalk at the school bus stop, standing water about hubcap deep, drain not draining after the storm. Callback at 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Okay, thanks Kevin. I'll watch for them Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good, Richard. Tell your nephew good luck with the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
